  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Stein-N/resources/main/images/resource_gamma_utils/rc_gamma_utils_title.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>簡單乾淨的伽馬值模組，適用於所有模組載入器，沒有任何繁雜設定。</h2>\n<h3>功能：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>按下 <code>H</code> 啟動全亮模式</li>\n<li>快捷鍵可自訂</li>\n<li>當安裝 Iris 並啟用光影時，將啟動夜視效果而非最高伽馬值</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Stein-N/resources/main/images/resource_gamma_utils/resource_gamma_util_example.gif\" alt=\"\"></p>",
